WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
In England the landlord must check your «right to rent» before the tenancy (with a share code). In England and Wales, the landlord must protect your deposit in an official scheme (DPS, MyDeposits or TDS) within 30 days. Ask for the certificate.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.200
At the end, they must return it within 10 days of agreeing the amount.

3
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:39.200
TV licence: you need one to watch or record live TV on any channel or platform, and for BBC iPlayer. Netflix or YouTube do not need one. It costs £180 a year from April 2026. 999: an emergency or a crime in progress.

4
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:46.800
101: the police when it is not urgent. 111: health, urgent but not an emergency.

5
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:54.000
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
